# Requisition Raid, modes 1 and 3: destroy Bot1's own Mox Emerald and put counters on Bot2's creatures. Bot2 answers with
# Dawn's Truce and gains hexproof (its permanents too): the player target is illegal, so the counters mode does nothing,
# while the artifact mode, whose target is still legal, destroys the Mox (CR 608.2b).

